Cell["\<\
Predict the factorization of the monic difference f/lc - g/lc from the \
prebuilt factor table (or compute it on a miss); for a degree-1 pair it \
returns the factors of the resultant -Res/(lc lc).\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c4a2ab5a-141b-48bf-9981-e153b0a07ae4"],

